    "their rewards compared with the give_exp2/change_money calls in the same",
    "state. The compiled catalog follows the operations, not the prose, and the",
    "divergence is recorded in docs/rebuild/original-security-notes.md.",
    "main_quest_lv2's give-up branch is a GM shortcut in the original script.",
    "It is compiled as an operator-only trigger instead of a public player path."
